# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# The raw camera masters. Deliberately not published: they are 75MB of
# unreleased footage and the site does not need them — they were only
# the input to the encodes in assets/video/, which ARE committed.
# Keep them somewhere backed up; the encode recipes are in README.md.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anchored to the repo root with a leading slash. An unanchored
# `*.MP4` also matches `.mp4` on Windows, where git is case-insensitive
# by default — which silently excluded all 22 encoded plates in
# assets/video/ and would have shipped a film with no film in it.
/*.mov
/*.MP4
